      "writtenOn": "2018-08-13T17:14:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The concern is that we may need to add explicit cache flushing if we access the buffer from two aliases on a virtually-indexed-virtually-tagged cpu. Since it is unlikely that this will ever run on a VIVT cpu (ARMv5?), it seemed better to exclude that case than to add the flushing.",
      "parentUuid": "b4d9cb08_dd848e65",
      "range": {
