      "writtenOn": "2018-08-13T17:14:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it really matters. No one can use it until this transaction is delivered to userspace. My rationale was that it seemed better to patch the transaction after the fd is setup in the fd table not when it\u0027s an unassociated fd. Why do you think it would be better before fd_install()?",
